@startuml admin-system-config
!include admin-common.puml
title Configuration du système

== Configuration système ==
Admin -> Frontend: Modifier paramètres système
Frontend -> API: PUT /api/admin/settings
note right
Body: {maintenanceMode: false, rateLimits: {...}}
end note
API -> Auth: Vérifier permissions admin
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> AdminCtrl: updateSystemSettings(settings)
AdminCtrl -> Redis: SET system:settings = {settings}
AdminCtrl -> Redis: PUBLISH config:update = {settings}
note right
Notify all instances to reload config
end note

AdminCtrl -> AuditSvc: logSystemConfigChange(adminId, changes)
AuditSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action: system_config_updated)

AdminCtrl --> API: settings updated
API --> Frontend: configuration saved
Frontend --> Admin: Configuration système mise à jour

@enduml